### API Route — vía Gateway (Sprint 3)
### Base: http://localhost:8000/api/v1_route

### 1. Crear ruta (sin filtro de categoría)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1_route/routes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_lat": 4.6097,
  "user_lng": -74.0817,
  "preferred_categories": [],
  "available_time_minutes": 180,
  "max_places": 4
}

###

### 2. Crear ruta (solo Museos, máx. 3 lugares)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1_route/routes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_lat": 4.6097,
  "user_lng": -74.0817,
  "preferred_categories": ["Museo"],
  "available_time_minutes": 180,
  "max_places": 3
}

###

### 3. Obtener ruta por ID (reemplaza {route_id} con el route_id de la respuesta POST)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1_route/routes/{{route_id}}

###

### 4. Listar rutas generadas
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1_route/routes

###
